    "text": "A bulb is placed at the centre of a circular track of radius $10 \\mathrm{~m}$. A vertical wall is erected touching the track at a point P. A man is running along the track with a speed of $10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{sec}$. Starting from $\\mathrm{P}$ the speed with which his shadow is running along the wall when he is at an angular distance of $60^{\\circ}$ from $P$ is",
